.el .ds Aq '
.TH imify 1 "" "imify" ""
.SH NAME
imify \- Command\-line interface for the imify platform
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimify\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-api\-url\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Command\-line interface for the imify platform
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Write JSON instead of text [env: IMIFY_OUTPUT=json]
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Write the result only
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more detail to stderr: \-v for debug, \-vv for trace
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Confirm without prompting
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable color [env: NO_COLOR]
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
API host [env: IMIFY_API_URL] [default: config file, then https://platform.imify.ai]
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
imify\-doctor(1)
Check the configuration, the API and the access token
.TP
imify\-auth(1)
Sign in, sign out and show the signed\-in user
.TP
imify\-config(1)
Read and change the settings in the config file
.TP
imify\-datasets(1)
Work with datasets
.TP
imify\-self(1)
Manage this imify installation
